  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "2. Sauté the onions and peppers until tender.",
    "3. Add the mushrooms and cook until they release their moisture.",
    "4. Add the zucchini and tomatoes, and cook until they begin to soften.",
    "5. Pour in the vegetable broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "6. Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20-25 minutes.",
    "7. Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
